nisms such as OAuth 2.0 is crucial. Inadequate authentication controls can lead to significant
security risks, exposing sensitive data [38].
3. Patch Management: Regular updates and patch management are critical for maintaining
security integrity, especially when known vulnerabilities arise [10, 39].

